702
00:27:53.610 --> 00:27:53.690
Yeah.
是啊。

703
00:27:53.770 --> 00:27:56.670
There were so many people who worked on this show.
这部剧的工作人员真的非常多。

704
00:27:56.930 --> 00:27:56.980
Mm-hmm.
嗯。

705
00:27:57.050 --> 00:27:58.290
The crew was humongous.
