706
00:27:58.290 --> 00:28:03.270
I have for later a little bit that would piggyback off of that for the costume department.
我后面还有点内容，正好可以顺着这个话题聊聊服装部门。

707
00:28:03.550 --> 00:28:04.710
Oh, okay.
