上面有点红色。

781
00:30:19.830 --> 00:30:20.450
It didn't have—
并没有——

782
00:30:20.450 --> 00:30:21.990
I'm not going to get in the weeds about it.
我不想在这上面钻牛角尖。

783
00:30:22.030 --> 00:30:22.230
Okay.
好吧。

784
00:30:22.330 --> 00:30:24.150
I did have a moment of curiosity.
