He really did it.
他是真的动手做了。

827
00:31:33.150 --> 00:31:37.290
They gave him a dead deer that he, one, practiced on, and then one, he did it.
他们给了他一只死鹿，他先是练习了一下，然后就真的动手处理了。

828
00:31:37.430 --> 00:31:37.770
Why?
为什么？

829
00:31:38.090 --> 00:31:38.490
Mm-mm.
嗯嗯。

830
00:31:39.170 --> 00:31:39.510
Unnecessary.
没必要。

831
00:31:39.650 --> 00:31:39.910
Mm-mm.
嗯嗯。

832
00:31:39.910 --> 00:31:43.590
You know what I just saw on Instagram that I was like, oh, my God, we have to ask for
